      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '         Dear Marta,


    I am writing to let you know that I will stop
    by the bar tomorrow to pick up the bottles I ordered.


    If you could set
    aside the large ones for me, I would appreciate it.


    Sincerely,

    Gabriel'
